' Domain relationships
User "1" -- "0..*" Order : places >
Kategori "1" -- "0..*" Obat : contains >
Obat "1" -- "0..*" OrderItem : referenced by >
Order "1" -- "0..*" OrderItem : owns >
Obat "1" -- "0..*" StockAddition : requested by >

' Controller usage relationships
DashboardController ..> Obat : queries
ObatController ..> Obat : manages
KategoriController ..> Kategori : manages
OrderController ..> Order : manages
OrderController ..> OrderItem : reads
ReportController ..> Order : reports
StockController ..> Obat : looks up
StockAdditionController ..> StockAddition : manages
StockAdditionController ..> Obat : updates
Pemilik\ObatController ..> Obat : approves
AuthController ..> User : authenticates
ProfileController ..> User : updates

